# LFG Filter (vendored Premade Groups Filter by Bernhard Saumweber, GPL-2.0-or-later).
# Order below matches the upstream PremadeGroupsFilter.toc, with three DanUI files:
#   LFGFilterDB.lua      must load FIRST - creates the saved-variable tables that
#                        the rewritten PGF source reads (DanUIDB.LFGFilter.*)
#   LFGFilterSkin.lua    restyles the group-finder dialog to the DUI theme
#   LFGFilterModule.lua  the DanUI module wrapper - must load LAST
# Never loaded: the Mists-only files (DanUI is retail-only) and Settings/Settings.xml
# (the Blizzard options panel was removed; the config lives in the DUI panel).
